{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef34d-e09b-7d12-a569-ae63f2da39c5", "item_id": "item-431", "rollout_ordinal": 3368, "created_at_ms": 1782198483774, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 3368, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-431", "text": "El proyecto está armado correctamente en Overleaf: aparecen `main.tex`, `README.txt` y la carpeta `figuras`. Ahora voy a compilar o revisar el panel de compilación.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ef34d-e09b-7d12-a569-ae63f2da39c5", "item_id": "call_nQNjPPEeMl7qCcVPciZvgIkS", "rollout_ordinal": 3371, "created_at_ms": 1782198485807, "item_type": "mcpToolCall", "updated_at_ordinal": 3371, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "mcpToolCall", "id": "call_nQNjPPEeMl7qCcVPciZvgIkS", "server": "node_repl", "tool": "js", "status": "completed", "arguments": {"code": "var snapAll = await tab.playwright.domSnapshot();\nvar lines = snapAll.split('\\n').filter(l => /Recompile|Compile|PDF|error|Error|Logs|Download|compil/i.test(l));\nnodeRepl.write(lines.slice(0, 120).join('\\n'));", "timeout_ms": 30000, "title": "Buscar compilación"}, "appContext": null, "mcpAppUi": null, "pluginId": null, "readOnlyHint": null, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "          - treeitem \"Errores frecuentes de estimación\":\n            - button \"Errores frecuentes de estimación\"\n      - button \"Click to hide the PDF\":\n  - region \"PDF preview\":\n    - toolbar \"PDF\":\n      - button \"Recompile\":\n        - generic: Recompile\n      - button \"Toggle compile options menu\":\n      - button \"Back to PDF\" [disabled]:\n        - generic: Back to PDF\n      - tab \"All logs 2\" [selected]:\n        - text: All logs\n      - tab \"Errors 2\":\n        - text: Errors\n    - generic \"An error which prevented this project from compiling\":\n        - heading \"No PDF\" [level=3]\n      - text: \"This compile didn’t produce a PDF. This can happen if:\"\n        - listitem: There is an unrecoverable LaTeX error. If there are LaTeX errors shown below or in the raw logs, please try to fix them and compile again.\n        - text: environment contains no content. If it’s empty, please add some content and compile again.\n        - code: output.pdf\n        - text: . If that file exists, please rename it and compile again.\n    - 'generic \"Log entry with level: error\"':\n        - 'heading \"Fatal Package fontspec Error: The fontspec package requires either XeTeX or\" [level=3]'\n      - generic: \"(fontspec) LuaTeX. (fontspec) (fontspec) You must change your typesetting engine to, (fontspec) e.g., \\\"xelatex\\\" or \\\"lualatex\\\" instead of (fontspec) \\\"latex\\\" or \\\"pdflatex\\\". Type <return> to continue. ... l.101 \\\\msg_fatal:nn {fontspec} {cannot-use-pdftex}\"\n    - 'generic \"Log entry with level: error\"':\n    - generic \"Raw logs from the LaTeX compiler\":\n        - heading \"Raw logs\" [level=3]\n    - button \"Other logs and files\""}], "structuredContent": null, "_meta": {"browser_use": {"url": "https://www.overleaf.com/project/6a3a306efdd5dbf0192323b4"}, "codex/toolSurface": {"backend": "iab", "kind": "browserUse"}}}, "error": null, "durationMs": 97}}
